From 217665e6cd1c5a5d12045077e3252ad2bf3e3ef1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 30 May 2026 15:14:03 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] feat(landing): swap founder placeholder for real photo
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Replaces the gradient "Founder photo — coming soon" placeholder in the
WHY WE BUILT IT section with the wedding photo of Hodari and Shylah Touré.

Image file (frontend/public/founders.jpg) is committed in a separate add
since Cowork's sandbox can't reach the user's ~/Developer/legacy_table
working tree; Doc places the file locally and stages it alongside this
JSX change.

Container changes to accommodate a landscape photo:
- max-w-sm → max-w-md (lets the wider photo breathe)
- removed aspect-[4/5] portrait constraint
- image renders at natural ratio inside the rounded shadow frame
- loading="lazy" since this is below the fold

Alt text: "Hodari and Shylah Touré, founders of Legacy Table" — meaningful
description rather than the broken-image "Founder photo" leak from the
original.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 frontend/public/founders.jpg         | Bin 0 -> 333626 bytes
 frontend/src/landing/LandingPage.jsx |  14 +++++++-------
 2 files changed, 7 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 frontend/public/founders.jpg

diff --git a/frontend/public/founders.jpg b/frontend/public/founders.jpg
new file mode 100644
